blueprint/src/chapter/ch13_qpbt_test.tex:464:	\uses{def:pauli-question-distribution, def:pauli-win-predicate, def:admissible, def:tensor-product-value, def:EPR, lem:pauli-observable-expansion, def:povm-distance}
